@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@couponId = 1
@productId = 3

### List coupon-product associations
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-products

### Filter associations by coupon
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-products?couponId={{couponId}}

### Get association by composite key
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-products/{{couponId}}/{{productId}}

### Associate product with coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon-products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponId": 1,
  "productId": 3
}

### Update association
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coupon-products/{{couponId}}/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 2
}

### Remove association
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coupon-products/{{couponId}}/{{productId}}
